hermes-agent-desktop (0.23.2+git20261118044130.f7e2898-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian.rules: override_dh_fixperms now runs dh_fixperms -Xchrome-sandbox; the plain chmod in dh_auto_install was reset by dh_fixperms, so the DEB shipped a 0755 sandbox. Proven with a real dh build in debian:sid: binary data tar carries -rwsr-xr-x root/root.

 -- Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:01:43 +0000

hermes-agent-desktop (0.23.2+git20261118044130.f7e2898-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * chrome-sandbox: promote it to 4755 at package build time like the
    heroic/stoat recipes; the payload ships it 0755 root:root with no
    fallback, so on kernels without unprivileged user namespaces the
    sandbox never launches.

 -- Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:26:42 +0000

